{"id":"ad1cb778dd1ba8fe","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set-meeting-filter.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Dense Set Meeting Filter","display":"df-zfc-forcing-dense-set-meeting-filter — ZFC Forcing Dense Set Meeting Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set-meeting-filter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set-meeting-filter"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-dense-set-meeting-filter — ZFC Forcing Dense Set Meeting Filter","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-dense.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set-meeting-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set-meeting-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-dense-set-meeting-filter — ZFC Forcing Dense Set Meeting Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-filter.md\">../batch15/58-df-filter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"681e6314e26cdd0b\" href=\"?note=681e6314e26cdd0b\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-dense.md\">../batch10/58-df-dense.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,R,1_P,\\mathcal D,G\\in V\">\\(P,R,1_P,\\mathcal D,G\\in V\\)</span> (forcing carrier, order, top condition, dense-set family, and filter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dense}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Dense}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DenseSetMeetingFilterStructure}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{DenseSetMeetingFilterStructure}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingDenseSetMeetingFilter}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingDenseSetMeetingFilter}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (explicit predicate and compatibility projection defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}dense\\text{-}set\\text{-}meeting\\text{-}filter\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{DenseSetMeetingFilterStructure}_S(G,\\mathcal D,P,R,1_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,R,1_P)\\land\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(P)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,P,R)\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;(\\mathrm{Dense}(D,P,R)\\land G\\cap D\\neq\\varnothing)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}dense\\text{-}set\\text{-}meeting\\text{-}filter\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{DenseSetMeetingFilterStructure}_S(G,\\mathcal D,P,R,1_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,R,1_P)\\land\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(P)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,P,R)\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;(\\mathrm{Dense}(D,P,R)\\land G\\cap D\\neq\\varnothing)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}dense\\text{-}set\\text{-}meeting\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingDenseSetMeetingFilter}_S(G,\\mathcal D,P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists R,1_P\\in V\\;\\mathrm{DenseSetMeetingFilterStructure}_S(G,\\mathcal D,P,R,1_P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}dense\\text{-}set\\text{-}meeting\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingDenseSetMeetingFilter}_S(G,\\mathcal D,P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists R,1_P\\in V\\;\\mathrm{DenseSetMeetingFilterStructure}_S(G,\\mathcal D,P,R,1_P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The order relation and greatest condition are explicit in the structure predicate; the three-argument label remains an existential projection.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-dense.md","status":"resolved","id":"681e6314e26cdd0b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-dense.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,R,1_P,\\mathcal D,G\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dense}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DenseSetMeetingFilterStructure}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingDenseSetMeetingFilter}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}dense\\text{-}set\\text{-}meeting\\text{-}filter\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{DenseSetMeetingFilterStructure}_S(G,\\mathcal D,P,R,1_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,R,1_P)\\land\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(P)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,P,R)\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;(\\mathrm{Dense}(D,P,R)\\land G\\cap D\\neq\\varnothing)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}dense\\text{-}set\\text{-}meeting\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingDenseSetMeetingFilter}_S(G,\\mathcal D,P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists R,1_P\\in V\\;\\mathrm{DenseSetMeetingFilterStructure}_S(G,\\mathcal D,P,R,1_P)","display":true}],"bytes":1761,"backlinks":[{"id":"a6d94737d6a53725","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DenseSetMeetingFilterStructure}_S$ (order-explicit dense-set-meeting filter predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set-meeting-filter]])"},{"id":"287ea7fe632b00c1","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DenseSetMeetingFilterStructure}_S$ (order-explicit dense-set-meeting filter predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set-meeting-filter]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1955","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set-meeting-filter.md|58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set-meeting-filter]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["1331244a5201bb99","681e6314e26cdd0b","b5833df5ef175153"]}